WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:15.280
I want to continue in volume 4 and it's January the 5th, 1901 and the subject is obedience.

2
00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:21.200
The Weezer said, "As I was outside of myself, I saw the confessor placing the intention

