4
00:00:24.120 --> 00:00:28.840
I was afraid to submit myself, but Jesus told me, 'What can I do?

5
00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:35.760
I cannot help obeying, because my humanity was made on purpose to obey."

6
00:00:35.760 --> 00:00:42.320
That's John 1431, as well as all the other references in John where Jesus says, "I only

7
00:00:42.320 --> 00:00:45.160
