obedience is nature in me, now he's going to tell her, "I am obedience."

15
00:01:32.200 --> 00:01:39.680
It was nature in me and the distinction dearest and most glorious to me, so much so that if

16
00:01:39.680 --> 00:01:45.560
my humanity did not have this of its own, I would abhor it and I would never have united

17
00:01:45.560 --> 00:01:48.120
