myself," she said, "and Jesus shared with me the pains of the cross."

24
00:02:19.400 --> 00:02:28.720
After this, Jesus transported me outside of myself and blessed Jesus gave me a kiss.

25
00:02:28.720 --> 00:02:34.800
As he was doing this, a bitter breath came out of him and he was in the act of wanting

26
