That's the very important thing, that loving and possession go together.

148
00:12:50.760 --> 00:12:59.360
So January 9, 1901, the subject here now is union.

149
00:12:59.360 --> 00:13:05.280
This morning I felt all oppressed and crushed, so much so that I went in search of relief.

150
00:13:05.280 --> 00:13:09.560
My only good made me wait a long time for his coming.

151
